# ── FLOW: USER PREFERENCE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Given "^user preferences are set to application defaults$"
    Given atomic user preferences are set to application defaults

@When "^none blotter view is visible in the application$"
    When page trade portal closes New Today Blotter view
    Then page trade portal New Today Blotter view is not visible
    And page trade portal Validation Blotter view is not visible
    And page trade portal Pending Approval Blotter view is not visible

@When "^changes the theme preference$"
    When page user preference clicks theme toggle button

@When "^changes the number format preference to '([^']*)' and date format preference to '([^']*)'$"
    When page user preference opens settings panel
    And page user preference clicks number format button
    And click option from stored variable '$1.numberOptionLabel'
    And page user preference clicks date format button
    And click option from stored variable '$1.dateOptionLabel'
    And page user preference closes settings panel

@When "^changes the blotter view to show blotters$"
    When page trade portal clicks New Today Blotter button
    And page trade portal clicks Validation Blotter button
    And page trade portal clicks Pending Approval Blotter button

@When "^updates theme and blotter view preferences$"
    When changes the theme preference
    And changes the blotter view to show blotters

@Then "^the updated theme and blotter view preferences are applied$"
    Then page user preference dark theme is applied
    And the configured Trades blotter view preference is applied in the settings

@Then "^the updated theme and blotter view preferences persist after re-login$"
    Then page user preference dark theme is applied
    And the configured Trades blotter view preference is applied in the settings

@Then "^the number format is applied for '([^']*)' and date format is applied for '([^']*)' in the blotter$"
    Then page trade portal searches and views trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal blotter column 'premiumAmount' matches stored variable '$1.premiumAmount'
    And page trade portal blotter column 'valueDate' matches stored variable '$2.expectedValueDateLabel'

@Then "^the number and date format preferences persist after refresh for '([^']*)'$"
    Then atomic refresh webpage and wait for page ready
    And the number format is applied for '$1' and date format is applied for '$1' in the blotter

@Then "^the configured Trades blotter view preference is applied in the settings$"
    Then page trade portal New Today Blotter view is visible
    And page trade portal Validation Blotter view is visible
    And page trade portal Pending Approval Blotter view is visible
